  "Description": {
    "Cost": 2834807,
    "UIName": "Smilodon",
    "Id": "chassisdef_smilodon_SMI-4",
    "Name": "Smilodon",
    "Details": "The Smilodon 4 mounts a Hyper PPC paired with a Particle Recycler for amplified plasma discharge, alongside a Heavy Siege Laser insulated for sustained fire. Two Flechette 5s provide rapid kinetic salvos at moderate range, while a single Early Clan ER Small Laser offers close-range defense. The configuration integrates a Guardian ECM for electronic warfare protection and the PHI Suite for shared targeting data across the lance. This variant is tailored for heavy precision strikes with supplemental area saturation, delivering high burst damage in mid-range engagements while maintaining limited defensive capability at close quarters.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - PPC</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.32</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_smilodon"
